{"id":"606e80f9b8f16fc2","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-thm-cartans-theorem-b.md","title":"Cartan's Theorem B","display":"thm-cartans-theorem-b — Cartan's Theorem B","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-cartans-theorem-b","aliases":["58-thm-cartans-theorem-b"],"display":"thm-cartans-theorem-b — Cartan's Theorem B","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-coherent-sheaf.md]]","[[./58-df-sheaf-cohomology.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-stein-manifold.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-cartans-theorem-b"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-cartans-theorem-b</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cartans-theorem-b — Cartan's Theorem B"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"13f5e356bc6a9655\" href=\"?note=13f5e356bc6a9655\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-coherent-sheaf.md\">../batch15/58-df-coherent-sheaf.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3de4d546216326d8\" href=\"?note=3de4d546216326d8\" title=\"./58-df-sheaf-cohomology.md\">58-df-sheaf-cohomology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca89eef53dcad278\" href=\"?note=ca89eef53dcad278\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-stein-manifold.md\">../batch01/58-df-stein-manifold.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal O_X,\\mathcal F,U,\\mathsf{ShAb}_{X,\\tau},\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma_X,0_{\\mathsf{Ab}}\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal O_X,\\mathcal F,U,\\mathsf{ShAb}_{X,\\tau},\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma_X,0_{\\mathsf{Ab}}\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,q\\in\\omega\">\\(n,q\\in\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stein}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Stein}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> is as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca89eef53dcad278\" href=\"?note=ca89eef53dcad278\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-stein-manifold.md\">../batch01/58-df-stein-manifold.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoherentModuleSheaf}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{CoherentModuleSheaf}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> is as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"13f5e356bc6a9655\" href=\"?note=13f5e356bc6a9655\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-coherent-sheaf.md\">../batch15/58-df-coherent-sheaf.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> is as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3de4d546216326d8\" href=\"?note=3de4d546216326d8\" title=\"./58-df-sheaf-cohomology.md\">58-df-sheaf-cohomology.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolomorphicSteinDatum}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal O_X,n,U)\">\\(\\mathrm{HolomorphicSteinDatum}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal O_X,n,U)\\)</span> means that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\tau,\\mathcal A)\">\\((\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\)</span> is one fixed witness to the defining Stein predicate and that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_X\">\\(\\mathcal O_X\\)</span> is the sheaf of holomorphic functions for that same complex structure, coded in the universe <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroObject}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(0_{\\mathsf{Ab}},\\mathsf{Ab})\">\\(\\mathrm{ZeroObject}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(0_{\\mathsf{Ab}},\\mathsf{Ab})\\)</span> is the zero-object relation for the chosen category of abelian groups.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cartan\\text{-}b} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Stein}_S(X,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{HolomorphicSteinDatum}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal O_X,n,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{CoherentModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,X,\\tau,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZeroObject}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(0_{\\mathsf{Ab}},\\mathsf{Ab})\n\\to\\forall q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S(0_{\\mathsf{Ab}},q,X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{ShAb}_{X,\\tau},\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cartan\\text{-}b} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Stein}_S(X,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{HolomorphicSteinDatum}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal O_X,n,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{CoherentModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,X,\\tau,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZeroObject}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(0_{\\mathsf{Ab}},\\mathsf{Ab})\n\\to\\forall q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S(0_{\\mathsf{Ab}},q,X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{ShAb}_{X,\\tau},\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Theorem A: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span> is generated by global sections.</li>\n<li>Theorem B: Higher cohomology vanishes for coherent sheaves on Stein manifolds.</li>\n<li>The topology used by coherence and cohomology is now the topology of the same fixed Stein presentation, and vanishing means isomorphism to a typed zero object rather than equality with the ambient set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Implies solvability of Cousin problems and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{\\partial}\">\\(\\bar{\\partial}\\)</span>-problems.</li>\n<li>Foundation of complex analysis on Stein manifolds.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-coherent-sheaf.md","status":"resolved","id":"13f5e356bc6a9655","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-coherent-sheaf.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-sheaf-cohomology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3de4d546216326d8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-sheaf-cohomology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-stein-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca89eef53dcad278","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-stein-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-stein-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca89eef53dcad278","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Stein}_S\\subseteq V^2$ is as in [[../batch01/58-df-stein-manifold.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-coherent-sheaf.md","status":"resolved","id":"13f5e356bc6a9655","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CoherentModuleSheaf}_S\\subseteq V^5$ is as in [[../batch15/58-df-coherent-sheaf.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-sheaf-cohomology.md","status":"resolved","id":"3de4d546216326d8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S\\subseteq V^8$ is as in [[./58-df-sheaf-cohomology.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal O_X,\\mathcal F,U,\\mathsf{ShAb}_{X,\\tau},\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma_X,0_{\\mathsf{Ab}}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n,q\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stein}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CoherentModuleSheaf}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HolomorphicSteinDatum}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal O_X,n,U)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\tau,\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_X","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZeroObject}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(0_{\\mathsf{Ab}},\\mathsf{Ab})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cartan\\text{-}b} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Stein}_S(X,n)\\land\n\\mathrm{HolomorphicSteinDatum}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal O_X,n,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{CoherentModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,X,\\tau,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZeroObject}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(0_{\\mathsf{Ab}},\\mathsf{Ab})\n\\to\\forall q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{SheafCohomology}_S(0_{\\mathsf{Ab}},q,X,\\tau,\\mathcal F,\\mathsf{ShAb}_{X,\\tau},\\mathsf{Ab},\\Gamma_X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{\\partial}","display":false}],"bytes":2195,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4068","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-thm-cartans-theorem-b.md|58-thm-cartans-theorem-b]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["13f5e356bc6a9655","3de4d546216326d8","ca89eef53dcad278"]}